      },
      "message": "feat(app): Duplicate copies a tool with its holder and component stack\n\nDuplicateTool copies a document tool as a new tool: the definition,\nthe holder body, the drawn cutter and the component stack, under a\nfree name (\"<name> (2)\", ...) and the next free tool number. It is one\nundo step. The MCP tool duplicate_tool runs it. The tool editor's\nDuplicate button is enabled and opens the copy.\n\nFixes #4340\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
