        "date": "2026-11-28T01:42:31Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): Duplicate waits for an applied tool draft\n\nThe tool editor's Duplicate copies the applied tool. With unapplied edits\nin the draft, the copy replaced the editor and the edits were lost. Now\nDuplicate is disabled while the draft differs from the applied tool, and\nits hover text says to Apply or Cancel first.\n\nThe MCP duplicate_tool description now lists the \"no free copy name\"\nrefusal too (docs/agents/mcp-tools.md row follows).\n\nRefs #4340\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
